{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Combinatorics.Young.YoungDiagram","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":40,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.identityA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.identityA","kind":"theorem","line":600,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L600-L606","doc":"**Identity (A), general form** — `Σ hook² = Σ content² + n²`, for every Young diagram `μ`.\nProved by the algebraic expansion (`sumSq_hook_expand`) composed with the now-discharged heart\n(`statistics_combine`). Sorry-free. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.statistics_combine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.statistics_combine","kind":"theorem","line":578,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L578-L598","doc":"**The heart (sorry-free).** The six statistic sums combine to `Σ content² + n²`, proved by\ncombining the fiberwise reflections `Σ arm² = Σ(col)²`, `Σ leg² = Σ(row)²`, `Σ arm = Σ col`,\n`Σ leg = Σ row` with the cross-term closed form `two_sum_armleg`.\n-- Ref: [leitner2026] docs/audits/2026-06-23-keystone-identity-I-content-decomposition.md §\"Proof of (A)\" ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.two_sum_armleg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.two_sum_armleg","kind":"theorem","line":550,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L550-L576","doc":"**Cross-term closed form (the crux, sorry-free).**\n`2·Σ arm·leg = numCells² + numCells − Σ rowLen(c.1) − Σ colLen(c.2) − 2·Σ(c.1·c.2)`,\nfrom the 9-class partition of `cells ×ˢ cells` with the four quadrant cards\n(NE = SW = `Σ arm·leg`, NW = SE = `Σ c.1·c.2`), the two axis cards, and the diagonal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_colLen_cells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_colLen_cells","kind":"theorem","line":539,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L539-L548","doc":"Transpose: `Σ colLen(c.2) = Σ leg + Σ(c.1) + numCells`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_rowLen_cells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_rowLen_cells","kind":"theorem","line":528,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L528-L537","doc":"`Σ rowLen(c.1) = Σ arm + Σ(c.2) + numCells` (pointwise `rowLen i = arm + j + 1` on cells). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_leg_eq_sum_row","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_leg_eq_sum_row","kind":"theorem","line":519,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L519-L526","doc":"Transpose of `sum_arm_eq_sum_col`: `Σ leg = Σ (row index)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_eq_sum_col","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_eq_sum_col","kind":"theorem","line":506,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L506-L517","doc":"Per-row reflection: `Σ arm = Σ (col index)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_diag_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_diag_eq","kind":"theorem","line":483,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L483-L503","doc":"`#{(P,Q) : P = Q} = numCells`: the diagonal of `cells ×ˢ cells`, via `p ↦ p.1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_colEq_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_colEq_eq","kind":"theorem","line":439,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L439-L481","doc":"`#{(P,Q) : colP = colQ} = Σ_c colLen(c.2)` (transpose of `card_rowEq_eq`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_rowEq_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_rowEq_eq","kind":"theorem","line":394,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L394-L437","doc":"`#{(P,Q) : rowP = rowQ} = Σ_c rowLen(c.1)`: the fiber over `P` is its whole row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_product_partition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_product_partition","kind":"theorem","line":376,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L376-L392","doc":"**9-class trichotomy partition** of `cells ×ˢ cells` (diag moved left to avoid `ℕ` subtraction):\nevery ordered pair lands in exactly one of NE / SW / NW / SE / row-equal / col-equal, with the\ndiagonal double-counted by the two equalities. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_bigNW_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_bigNW_eq","kind":"theorem","line":336,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L336-L374","doc":"**`card(bigNW) = Σ_c (row·col)`.** For `(P,Q)` with `P` strictly NW of `Q`, the fiber over\n`Q = (i,j)` is `{P : P.1 < i ∧ P.2 < j} = range i ×ˢ range j` (left-justified rows make the whole\nNW rectangle present), card `i·j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_bigSE_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_bigSE_eq","kind":"theorem","line":325,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L325-L334","doc":"`card(bigSE) = card(bigNW)` by the swap involution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_bigSW_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.card_bigSW_eq","kind":"theorem","line":314,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L314-L323","doc":"`card(bigSW) = card(bigNE)` by the swap involution `(P,Q) ↦ (Q,P)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_armleg_eq_card_bigNE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_armleg_eq_card_bigNE","kind":"theorem","line":292,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L292-L312","doc":"**`Σ arm·leg = card(bigNE)`.** Sum the rectangle cardinality over cells and reindex by the\ncorner map `(R,S) ↦ (R.1, S.2)` (`card_eq_sum_card_fiberwise` + `fiber_card`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.fiber_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.fiber_card","kind":"theorem","line":249,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L249-L290","doc":"The fiber of `bigNE` over corner cell `(i,j)` has card `(rowLen i − j − 1)(colLen j − i − 1)`:\n`(R,S) ↦ (R.2, S.1)` is a bijection onto `Ioo j (rowLen i) ×ˢ Ioo i (colLen j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.bigSE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.bigSE","kind":"def","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L245-L247","doc":"`R` strictly SE of `S`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.bigNW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.bigNW","kind":"def","line":242,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L242-L244","doc":"`R` strictly NW of `S`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.bigSW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.bigSW","kind":"def","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L239-L241","doc":"`R` strictly SW of `S`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.bigNE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.bigNE","kind":"def","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L236-L238","doc":"`R` strictly NE of `S`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.arm_mul_leg_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.arm_mul_leg_card","kind":"theorem","line":228,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L228-L234","doc":"`arm·leg` on a cell, as the `ℤ`-cast of a `Nat` rectangle cardinality. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_leg_sq_eq_sum_isq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_leg_sq_eq_sum_isq","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L211-L218","doc":"**R2 over cells.** `Σ leg² = Σ (row index)²`, via the transpose bridge (R1 on `μᵀ`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_sq_eq_sum_jsq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_sq_eq_sum_jsq","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L205-L209","doc":"**R1 over cells.** `Σ arm² = Σ (col index)²`; both reduce to `Σ_i Σ_{j<rowLen i} j²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_sq_row","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_sq_row","kind":"theorem","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L192-L203","doc":"**R1 (per row).** `Σ_{c∈row i} arm² = Σ_{j<rowLen i} j²`: in row `i` the arm\n`rowLen i − j − 1` ranges over `{0,…,rowLen i−1}`, the same set as the column index `j`\n(reflection `j ↦ rowLen i − 1 − j`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_transpose_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_transpose_swap","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L183-L190","doc":"General transpose bridge: `Σ_{c∈μᵀ.cells} g c = Σ_{c∈μ.cells} g c.swap`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_row_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_row_eq","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L178-L181","doc":"Generic per-row reducer: `Σ_{c∈row i} f c = Σ_{j<rowLen i} f (i,j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_leg_cells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_leg_cells","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L156-L164","doc":"**`Σ leg` in closed form**, for free from the conjugation bridge: `Σ leg` over `μ` is the\narm-sum over `μ.transpose`, hence `Σ_i Σ_{k < μ.transpose.rowLen i} k` (`= Σ_j C(colLen_j, 2)`).\nA one-line corollary of `sum_arm_transpose_eq_sum_leg` + `sum_arm_cells` — the payoff of the\ntranspose bridge. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_cells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_cells","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L147-L154","doc":"**`Σ arm` in closed form**: the arm-sum over all cells is `Σ_i Σ_{k < rowLen i} k`\n(`= Σ_i C(rowLen_i, 2)`). Combines `sum_cells_fiberwise` with `sum_arm_row`; the first concrete\nstatistic of the heart. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_row","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_row","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L137-L145","doc":"**Per-row arm sum** = Gauss sum of the row length: `Σ_{c ∈ row i} arm = Σ_{k < rowLen i} k`\n(`= rowLen_i·(rowLen_i − 1)/2`), via `row_eq_prod` + the reflection `b ↦ rowLen_i − 1 − b`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_cells_fiberwise","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_cells_fiberwise","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L122-L135","doc":"**Cells decompose into rows** (general, reusable). Any cell-sum is the sum over rows\n`i < μ.colLen 0` (the number of rows) of the sum over that row. The workhorse for turning a\ncell-statistic into a row-by-row computation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_transpose_eq_sum_leg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_arm_transpose_eq_sum_leg","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L110-L120","doc":"**Conjugation relation (leg-sum = transpose arm-sum).** Via the cell swap\n`μ.transpose.cells = (prodComm) '' μ.cells`, the arm-sum over `μ.transpose` equals the leg-sum over\n`μ`. This is the structural bridge the heart uses to trade leg-statistics for arm-statistics. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.leg_eq_arm_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.leg_eq_arm_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L104-L108","doc":"**Pointwise conjugation.** The leg of `c` in `μ` is the arm of `c.swap` in `μ.transpose`:\n`leg μ (i,j) = μ.colLen j − i − 1 = μ.transpose.rowLen j − i − 1 = arm μ.transpose (j,i)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.content_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.content_swap","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L99-L102","doc":"Content negates under the transpose cell-swap `(i,j) ↦ (j,i)`: `content (j,i) = − content (i,j)`.\nHence `Σ content²` is transpose-invariant — one of the symmetries the heart exploits. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sumSq_hook_expand","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sumSq_hook_expand","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L86-L97","doc":"**Algebraic expansion of `Σ hook²`** (sorry-free): pure `Finset`-linearity + `ring`.\nReduces Identity (A) to the six per-statistic sums. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_one_eq_numCells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.sum_one_eq_numCells","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L81-L84","doc":"The constant term: `Σ_cells 1 = n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.numCells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.numCells","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L78-L79","doc":"Number of cells, `n = |μ|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.hook","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.hook","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L75-L76","doc":"Hook length of `c` is `arm + leg + 1` — the number of cells in the hook of `c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.content","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.content","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L72-L73","doc":"Content of cell `(i, j)` is `j − i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.leg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.leg","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L69-L70","doc":"Leg of cell `c = (i, j)` in `μ`: cells strictly below in the same column. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.arm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityAArmLeg.arm","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/IdentityAArmLeg.lean#L66-L67","doc":"Arm of cell `c = (i, j)` in `μ`: cells strictly to the right in the same row. ","signatureChunk":0}]}